# game/case05.rpy:82
translate schinese press_eiki_1_e3763dea:

    # you "Who says it vanished at three?"
    you "谁说是三点消失的？"

# game/case05.rpy:83
translate schinese press_eiki_1_b7c31367:

    # eiki "Sakuya's roster, and Sakuya's pocket watch. The time is not in dispute."
    eiki "咲夜的名册，还有咲夜的怀表。时间没有争议。"

# game/case05.rpy:87
translate schinese press_eiki_2_8b96bace:

    # you "If Meiling didn't take it, who did?"
    you "如果不是美铃拿的，那是谁？"

# game/case05.rpy:89
translate schinese press_eiki_2_69a37da6:

    # eiki "Undetermined. Not every case needs a culprit. Some only need a verdict."
    eiki "尚未确定。不是每个案子都需要犯人。有的只需要判决。"

# game/case05.rpy:91
translate schinese press_eiki_2_8f39dcbd:

    # komachi "That's... not a great sentence, boss."
    komachi "这句话……不太妙啊，四季大人。"

# game/case05.rpy:95
translate schinese press_eiki_3_adb42788:

    # you "Why can't the appeal succeed?"
    you "为什么上诉不能成立？"

# game/case05.rpy:97
translate schinese press_eiki_3_d55cc248:

    # eiki "Because my verdicts are correct. Obviously."
    eiki "因为我的判决是正确的。理所当然。"

# game/case05.rpy:98
translate schinese press_eiki_3_175db7f6:

    # eiki "Enter that into my testimony, Junior Judge. In full."
    eiki "把这句记进我的证词，见习法官。一字不差。"

# game/case05.rpy:102
translate schinese press_eiki_4_1369d0e5:

    # you "How do you know your verdicts are correct?"
    you "你怎么知道你的判决是正确的？"

# game/case05.rpy:103
translate schinese press_eiki_4_b02a74ba:

    # eiki "Because I gave them. Were you not listening?"
    eiki "因为是我下的判决。你没在听吗？"

# game/case05.rpy:105
translate schinese press_eiki_4_e788fa5f:

    # komachi "Boss, that's the reason and the answer. It's the same thing twice."
    komachi "四季大人，理由和答案是同一句话。你只是说了两遍。"

# game/case05.rpy:116
translate schinese case5_3af4f096:

    # eiki "Order. The Higan Court of Logic is in session."
    eiki "肃静。彼岸逻辑法庭现在开庭。"

# game/case05.rpy:118
translate schinese case5_b506956e:

    # eiki "Komachi. The defendant?"
    eiki "小町。被告呢？"

# game/case05.rpy:119
translate schinese case5_847bf41e:

    # komachi "About that, boss. There isn't one. It's an appeal."
    komachi "这个嘛，四季大人。没有被告。是上诉。"

# game/case05.rpy:120
translate schinese case5_c03b32ca:

    # eiki "An appeal of what?"
    eiki "对什么的上诉？"

# game/case05.rpy:121
translate schinese case5_2641c76c:

    # komachi "The vanished pudding. The mansion says the thief was never found."
    komachi "消失的布丁案。红魔馆说，小偷一直没找到。"

# game/case05.rpy:122
translate schinese case5_46dcb941:

    # komachi "And a cup turned up at Misty Lake. Frozen solid."
    komachi "还有，在雾之湖发现了一个杯子。冻得硬邦邦的。"

# game/case05.rpy:123
translate schinese case5_2ba3b55e:

    # eiki "That case is closed. I closed it."
    eiki "那个案子已经结了。是我结的。"

# game/case05.rpy:124
translate schinese case5_e7448c0e:

    # komachi "The appeal names your verdict, boss. A judge can't hear her own appeal."
    komachi "上诉针对的是您的判决，四季大人。法官不能审理针对自己的上诉。"

# game/case05.rpy:126
translate schinese case5_47a1d365:

    # eiki "..."
    eiki "……"

# game/case05.rpy:127
translate schinese case5_19d3aa65:

    # eiki "...Rules are rules. Even mine. Especially mine."
    eiki "……规则就是规则。我的也一样。尤其是我的。"

# game/case05.rpy:128
translate schinese case5_fd6e30cc:

    # eiki "Junior Judge. Take the bench. I will take the stand."
    eiki "见习法官。坐到审判席上去。我来站证人席。"

# game/case05.rpy:131
translate schinese case5_5411b165:

    # eiki "Shiki Eiki, Yama of Paradise. I will explain why this appeal wastes everyone's afternoon."
    eiki "四季映姬·亚玛萨那度。我来说明，这次上诉为何是在浪费所有人的下午。"

# game/case05.rpy:134
translate schinese case5_a907644c:

    # komachi "The bench is yours, Junior Judge. The gavel's heavier than it looks."
    komachi "审判席归你了，见习法官。法槌比看起来重。"

# game/case05.rpy:135
translate schinese case5_7dd9328e:

    # komachi "The boss always says it: listen for where the reasons run in circles."
    komachi "四季大人总是说：留意理由在哪里绕圈子。"

# game/case05.rpy:149
translate schinese case5_ab2c0e3d:

    # eiki_t "The pudding vanished from the mansion kitchen at three o'clock."
    eiki_t "布丁在三点钟从红魔馆的厨房消失了。"

# game/case05.rpy:150
translate schinese case5_16506389:

    # eiki_t "Hong Meiling was found not guilty. I reviewed every page of that trial."
    eiki_t "红美铃被判无罪。那场审理的每一页我都复查过。"

# game/case05.rpy:151
translate schinese case5_2f71f08d:

    # eiki_t "This appeal cannot succeed. My verdict stands."
    eiki_t "这次上诉不能成立。我的判决维持不变。"

# game/case05.rpy:155
translate schinese case5_1c0b7ef4:

    # komachi "Your witness. [spirit_Word!t] magatama of spirit, same as always. She'd want it fair."
    komachi "证人交给你了。灵力勾玉照旧[spirit_Word!t]枚。她也会希望公平的。"

# game/case05.rpy:169
translate schinese case5_cross_1fa9e366:

    # komachi "Deep breath, Junior Judge. Even the boss gets a second hearing."
    komachi "深呼吸，见习法官。连四季大人都能有第二次审理。"

# game/case05.rpy:180
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_d381048b:

    # you "This cup came from the mansion and froze at Misty Lake. Your verdict says nothing about it."
    you "这个杯子来自红魔馆，在雾之湖结了冰。你的判决对此只字未提。"

# game/case05.rpy:181
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_560d3c82:

    # you "Your reason was your conclusion. Evidence breaks the circle. Your argument never left it."
    you "你的理由就是你的结论。证据能打破这个圈。你的论证从没走出过它。"

# game/case05.rpy:184
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_67403bfc:

    # eiki "My scales... They tipped. They have never tipped."
    eiki "我的天平……倾斜了。它从来没有倾斜过。"

# game/case05.rpy:187
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_07fd5c4e:

    # eiki "Circular reasoning. The conclusion hides inside the reason, so the argument only proves itself."
    eiki "循环论证。结论藏在理由里，所以这个论证只证明了它自己。"

# game/case05.rpy:188
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_b19921c2:

    # eiki "\"I am right because I am never wrong.\" I have sentenced souls for less."
    eiki "“我是对的，因为我从不犯错。”我曾因比这更轻的过错审判过灵魂。"

# game/case05.rpy:196
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_dda81141:

    # you "In the matter of the vanished pudding, this court finds the appeal..."
    you "关于消失的布丁一案，本庭对上诉判决……"

# game/case05.rpy:207
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_6a1b4911:

    # komachi "Case 03 is reopened. Which means we still need a thief."
    komachi "第三案重新审理。也就是说，我们还缺一个小偷。"

# game/case05.rpy:210
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_c6dacea2:

    # cirno "Hey! Who dug up my ice block? I was keeping that pudding cold!"
    cirno "喂！谁挖了我的冰块？我在给那个布丁保冷呢！"

# game/case05.rpy:212
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_29b6de30:

    # komachi "And there she is."
    komachi "她来了。"

# game/case05.rpy:215
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_722f3f16:

    # cirno "It was going to melt in that kitchen! I saved it. That makes me a hero."
    cirno "放在那个厨房里会化掉的！是我救了它。所以我是英雄。"

# game/case05.rpy:218
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_23854263:

    # eiki "Cirno. Saving it would mean giving it back. Not eating half."
    eiki "琪露诺。拯救它的意思是还回去，不是吃掉一半。"

# game/case05.rpy:219
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_3adc75a5:

    # eiki "...Junior Judge. This one is yours to sentence."
    eiki "……见习法官。这个判决交给你了。"

# game/case05.rpy:222
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_a0e5e9c0:

    # you "Return what's left of the pudding. And write \"a verdict needs evidence\" fifty times."
    you "把剩下的布丁还回去。再把“判决需要证据”写五十遍。"

# game/case05.rpy:226
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_73c1a30f:

    # eiki "Make it a hundred. I will write mine beside hers."
    eiki "改成一百遍。我也在她旁边一起写。"

# game/case05.rpy:227
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_40c1efee:

    # komachi "Court's adjourned, then. First time I've seen the boss on that side of the stand."
    komachi "那就退庭吧。第一次看到四季大人站在那一边。"

# game/case05.rpy:228
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_b1bb5a20:

    # eiki "And the last, Komachi."
    eiki "也是最后一次，小町。"

# game/case05.rpy:229
translate schinese case5_breakthrough_40be4001:

    # komachi "Whatever you say, boss."
    komachi "您说了算，四季大人。"

translate schinese strings:

    # game/case05.rpy:12
    old "Case 03 Verdict"
    new "第三案判决书"

    # game/case05.rpy:12
    old "Hong Meiling: NOT GUILTY. The real thief: \"Undetermined.\" Signed, Shiki Eiki."
    new "红美铃：无罪。真正的小偷：“尚未确定”。签名：四季映姬。"

    # game/case05.rpy:14
    old "Frozen Pudding Cup"
    new "冻住的布丁杯"

    # game/case05.rpy:14
    old "Found at Misty Lake inside a block of fairy ice. Bat crest on the cup. Half eaten."
    new "在雾之湖的妖精冰块里发现。杯子上有蝙蝠纹章。吃了一半。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "The Unappealable Verdict"
    new "不可上诉的判决"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "The pudding vanished from the mansion kitchen at three o'clock."
    new "布丁在三点钟从红魔馆的厨房消失了。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "The time's on the roster, Junior Judge. That part's solid."
    new "时间写在名册上了，见习法官。这部分站得住。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "Hong Meiling was found not guilty. I reviewed every page of that trial."
    new "红美铃被判无罪。那场审理的每一页我都复查过。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "Meiling's acquittal checks out. You helped win it, remember?"
    new "美铃的无罪判决没问题。你也帮忙打赢了，记得吗？"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "This appeal cannot succeed. My verdict stands."
    new "这次上诉不能成立。我的判决维持不变。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "That's a claim, not a reason. Press her for the reason first."
    new "那是主张，不是理由。先追问她的理由。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "My verdicts are correct because I gave them. And I only give correct verdicts."
    new "我的判决是正确的，因为是我下的。而我只下正确的判决。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "Close. But she isn't leaning on someone else's name. She's leaning on her own conclusion."
    new "接近了。但她倚靠的不是别人的名字，而是她自己的结论。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "Nothing here happens before anything else. The reasoning goes around, not forward."
    new "这里没有什么发生在什么之前。推理在原地打转，没有往前走。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "She isn't attacking anyone. She's defending her verdict with her verdict."
    new "她没有攻击任何人。她是在用她的判决为她的判决辩护。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "Nobody else is being blamed. Look at the reason, then look at the claim."
    new "没有人被指责。看看理由，再看看主张。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "No either-or here. Just one idea chasing its own tail."
    new "这里没有二选一。只有一个想法在追自己的尾巴。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "No chain of disasters. Just a circle."
    new "没有一连串的灾难。只是一个圈。"

    # game/case05.rpy:20
    old "That still comes from her. Show something that doesn't depend on her word."
    new "那还是出自她本人。拿出不依赖她说法的东西。"

    # game/case05.rpy:200
    old "UPHELD"
    new "上诉成立"

